Did anyone ever play this on the Commodore 64? It's remarkably similar 
to Nethack in a lot of ways. Randomised dungeons, trapped chests, 
enchanted weapons, sacrificing at altars, etc. If, in the early 
eighties, someone had turned Nethack into a coin-op arcade game, I 
suspect this is what it would have looked like.

